  "2026-08-01T19:37:48.032Z",codex,"Research is stored only in this PM item body. No standalone Lore research document or README/architecture link will be committed. Phase 3,Phase 5 and Phase 6 epics carry scoped conclusions; pm-vcs-ag8y,pm-vcs-vmmx,pm-vcs-0lec and pm-vcs-8xis carry implementation-ready acceptance boundaries."
  "2026-08-01T19:56:30.292Z",codex,"CodeRabbit PM review findings were applied only through pm CLI: security and transport acceptance criteria were strengthened,stable file identity now blocks the lock-dependent forge epic,duplicate FileId merge rejection is explicit,retain vocabulary is accepted,the Phase 5 relationship is linked,and all feature links resolve from the task item."
  "2026-08-01T21:05:57.256Z",codex,The maintainer explicitly requested detailed Lore documentation in the package. LORE.md now publishes the first-party-source research and capability decision map; this supersedes the earlier note that research would remain PM-only while preserving the PM item as the detailed project-management record.
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
